doc('01-git-baseline-dirty-worktree-and-attribution.md','Git baseline and preservation',f"Observed origin/main `{baseline['origin']}`; {baseline['ahead']} local commits retained. No fetch, merge, rebase, reset, stash or staging. Baseline includes the audit bootstrap file; all other original dirty rows belong to prior work. {ev('git-worktree-baseline.json')} records byte hashes and local log. {ev('changed-files-attribution.json')} has exact Codex hunks; {ev('preservation-diff.json')} checks protected source and prior reports.\n\nOriginal Phase07/08 work is retained, not restored to HEAD. Reliable before screenshots use the actual dirty initial build. The Phase08 preserved Phase07 patch is local comparison material, not blanket authorization to reverse it.\n\n"+table(['Path','Codex attribution','Hunks'],[(r['path'],r['attribution'],len(r['hunks']))for r in changed]))
